  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Womens Concealed Carry Hoodie is the ultimate sweatshirt that incorporates the best of both worlds by offering best-in-class discrete carry with quick and easy access to your firearm while providing unbeatable, long-lasting warmth and comfort. The pullover fleece hoodie features a specially designed kangaroo pocket with an inner CCW zipper for waistband carry draw. Whether you&rsquo;re out on the range, hiking, or running errands around town, this warm and soft CCW hoodie has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
