  "description": "<p>Our Womens Concealed Carry Hoodie is the ultimate sweatshirt that incorporates the best of both worlds by offering best-in-class discrete carry with quick and easy access to your firearm while providing unbeatable, long-lasting warmth and comfort. The pullover fleece hoodie features a specially designed kangaroo pocket with an inner CCW zipper for waistband carry draw. Whether you&rsquo;re out on the range, hiking, or running errands around town, this warm and soft CCW hoodie has everything you need to stay comfortable and prepared. Comfy Material: With a moisture wicking performance fabric and super soft fleece lining, these concealed carry pullover hooded sweatshirts offer all-day comfort, especially in the spring, fall, and winter seasons. Additional Warmth: These casual CCW sweatshirts feature a double-layer drawstring hood that keeps your head and neck warm while protecting you against the wind and rain. The 2 side zipper pockets help keep your hands warm. These performance hoodies feature cuffs with thumbholes that preserve heat and maintain range of motion, and prevent sleeve ride-up. Complete the Look: These comfy CCW hoodies are a perfect fit for anyone and work great with our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants and Womens Leggings. Don&rsquo;t Leave Home Without It: The Concealed Carry Hoodie is great for camping, hiking, running, jogging, traveling, lounging around, sports, gym, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
